{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A stealth-horror game where you\u2019re alone, unarmed, and being hunted. Every move must be careful. Explore a dark, hostile world and uncover a mystery hidden beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sneak. Survive. Discover the truth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/Gif_4.gif?t=1748988920\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Fight for Survival</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of Sara, separated from her family in a brutal conflict. To reunite with them, she must navigate the ruins of a shattered world, using stealth and puzzle-solving to evade enemy drones and a terrifying secret weapon that hunts her every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/Gif_3.gif?t=1748988920\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/Gif_2.gif?t=1748988920\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cinematic Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a third person exploration game where you traverse haunting landscapes, decaying cities, and uncovering clues about your loved ones. Strange balloons hint at a deeper mystery, drawing you into a gripping journey of hope and resilience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Haunting Soundtrack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A stirring, evocative score intensifies every moment, immersing you in a world forever changed by greed and destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/Gif_5.gif?t=1748988920\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2817920?t=1748988920","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748988920","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/1ac0081e3d74b84e1d4a768371d37189657677b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748988920","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/1ac0081e3d74b84e1d4a768371d37189657677b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748988920","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"A narrative stealth survival game exploring the civilian experience in a modern warzone.  You navigate the ruins of a fallen city, facing themes of loss, displacement, moral ambiguity, and the human cost of conflict. "},"demos":[{"appid":3554080,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A stealth-horror game where you\u2019re alone, unarmed, and being hunted. Every move must be careful. Explore a dark, hostile world and uncover a mystery hidden beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sneak. Survive. Discover the truth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2817920/extras/Gif_4.gif?t=1748988920\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Fight for Survival</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of Sara, separated from her family in a brutal conflict. To reunite with them, she must navigate the ruins of a shattered world, using stealth and puzzle-solv